    },
    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I would find more useful if cursorword module highlights instances of the current variable in the cursor instead of just copies of this word. It should be achievable via treesitter.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, a command to jump between those instances would be huge.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I would find more useful if cursorword module highlights instances of the current variable in the cursor instead of just copies of this word. It should be achievable via treesitter.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Additionally, a command to jump between those instances would be huge.</p>",
    "bodyText": "I would find more useful if cursorword module highlights instances of the current variable in the cursor instead of just copies of this word. It should be achievable via treesitter.\nAdditionally, a command to jump between those instances would be huge.",
    "category": {
